{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.three_parameters_wedderburn","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.three_parameters_wedderburn","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.three_parameters_wedderburn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.three_parameters_wedderburn","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/three_parameters_wedderburn.lean#L27-L36","doc":"**Three-parameter calibration matches Wedderburn block count**\n([`prop:three-parameters-wedderburn`]).\n\nThe number of calibration parameters equals the number of\nirreducible representations of `H₃(R, q)`, which equals 3. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:three-parameters-wedderburn","label":"prop:three-parameters-wedderburn","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/three-parameters-wedderburn.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.partitionCountOfThree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.partitionCountOfThree","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/three_parameters_wedderburn.lean#L24-L25","doc":"Number of partitions of `n = 3`: there are 3 ([(3)], [(2,1)], [(1,1,1)]). ","signatureChunk":0}]}